      "writtenOn": "2026-06-11T00:49:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Any reason why this needs to be manually copied instead of adding it as a dependency that can be kept in sync automatically? It looks like this directory is exported from Chromium as a pseudo repo https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/third_party/cpu_features/+/4974e2063946d9dd2a417c27db139fd982ff447a\n\nIs it due to the Chromium export not exporting the `src` directory?",
