      "writtenOn": "2026-06-17T17:20:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I didn\u0027t notice it had a pseudo repo for that, I was copying ANGLE\u0027s structure. But I tried using it and yeah, it doesn\u0027t really work, because it doesn\u0027t have `src` and I can\u0027t put one submodule inside another.\n\n`gclient sync` is perfectly fine with it, but the gitlinks can\u0027t possibly be checked into the repo, and that breaks `gclient gitmodules`. (Which probably isn\u0027t the end of the world, but I do rely on it for adding the gitlinks, even though it currently does something slightly wrong with placeholder_chromium.)",
